flowchart TD
    A["main() <br/> thread_counts = [1,2,4,8,16]"] --> B["for each t in thread_counts <br/> render_scene(t, image_t#.ppm, elapsed)"]
    B --> C["render_scene() <br/> • random_scene() <br/> • Camera(lookfrom/lookat) <br/> • image_buffer[W*H]"]
    C --> D["omp_set_num_threads(t) <br/> start = omp_get_wtime()"]
    D --> E["// PARALLEL REGION<br/>#pragma omp parallel for schedule(dynamic)"]
    E --> F["for j = H-1 downto 0<br/>(rows distributed dynamically)"]
    F --> G["seed_random(42+j, omp_get_thread_num())<br/>thread-local PCG RNG"]
    G --> H["for i = 0 .. W-1"]
    H --> I["pixel_color = 0<br/>for s = 0 .. SPP-1<br/>  u,v = (i+rand)/ (W-1)<br/>  r = cam.get_ray(u,v)<br/>  pixel_color += ray_color(r, world, depth)"]
    I --> J["image_buffer[(H-1-j)*W + i] = pixel_color"]
    J --> K{"More rows?"}
    K -->|Yes, idle thread grabs next row| F
    K -->|All rows done - implicit barrier| L["end = omp_get_wtime()<br/>elapsed = end-start"]
    L --> M["Serial I/O (outside timing)<br/>write P3 header + image_buffer → image_t#.ppm"]
    M --> N["return elapsed to main()"]
    N --> O["main: speedup = T1/Tp<br/>efficiency = speedup/t<br/>csv → benchmark_results.csv"]
    O --> P{"More t?"}
    P -->|Yes| B
    P -->|No| Q["Done - 5 images + CSV"]

    style E fill:#0b5394,stroke:#073763,color:#fff
    style G fill:#e69138,stroke:#b45f06,color:#fff
    style K fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656
    style M fill:#d9ead3,stroke:#6aa84f
